      "text": "Full-slide illustration: the grumpy cat in a green C@T hoodie rides a C@T-branded sleigh through rain, pulled by four robotic cats with glowing C@T badges, under a large empty thought bubble carrying the C@T logo. The slide overlays the folio-assistant site and repository links.",
